---
layout: base.njk
permalink: "/partners/"
title: "Nos partenaires"
description: "Ville d'Aubervilliers, C4.United, Auber Nations Cup, The Flat, OMJA : les partenaires de Tous Ensemble C'est Nous."
---
<section id="partners" class="first-section">
  <div class="partners-inner reveal visible" style="transition-delay: 0s;">
    <div class="section-label">{{ partnerspage.label }}</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">{{ partnerspage.title }}</h2>
    <p class="section-body" style="margin: 0 auto;">{{ partnerspage.intro }}</p>
    <div class="partners-grid">
      {% for p in collections.partners %}
      <div class="partner-card"><img src="{{ p.data.logo }}" alt="{{ p.data.name }}"></div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
